{{also|Ge'ez|Geez}}
==English==

===Etymology 1===
A [[minced oath]] from the word {{m|en|Jesus}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|en|geeze}}
* {{l|en|jeez}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/dʒiːz/}}
* {{audio|en|En-au-geez.ogg|Audio (AU)}}
{{rhymes|en|iːz}}

====Interjection====
{{en-interj}}

# {{lb|en|euphemistic}} {{n-g|An exclamation denoting [[surprise]] or [[frustration]].}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Geez''', that was one hell of a week.}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{seeSynonyms|en|wow}}

